WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.900
Spot the weak question.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.100
Here's how the flip test works.

3
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.800
Ask AI your exam question, just as a student would.

4
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.800
It answers instantly, without knowing anything about your course.

5
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.800
So judge it. Vulnerable, or resilient?

6
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.050
An instant answer means a weak question.

7
00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:23.450
So redesign it. Make it depend on something only your class has.

8
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.900
Now AI can't answer it. That question is resilient.

9
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.700
Three questions to test, two to redesign, and one on your own. Let's begin.
